lation, idempotency e audit evidence.","A resposta deve distinguir sucesso, validação, policy denial, dependency failure e entitlement absence."],"acceptance_criteria":["A execução autorizada de detectar conflito produz o estado esperado de AvailabilityRule e emite `product.schedule_ops.availability_engine.conflict_detect.completed` com correlation ID.","A repetição da mesma intenção com a mesma idempotency key não produz efeito duplicado nem evento material duplicado.","Um actor sem membership, permission ou entitlement efetivo recebe denial explícito e não observa dados protegidos.","Input inválido ou dependency failure encerra sem alteração parcial e registra erro taxonomizado e auditável.","Quando houver interface browser, loading, empty, validation, error, success, responsive Grid, teclado e screen reader são cobertos por Carbon."],"test_requirements":["contract_product_schedule_ops_availability_engine_conflict_detect","authorization_negative_and_cross_tenant","transaction_and_idempotency","event_audit_and_observability","carbon_accessibility_when_ui_exists"],"metrics":["success_rate","latency","policy_denial_rate","retry_rate","user_outcome"],"maturity":"development","release_gate":"contract+security+data+ui_when_applicable+observability","source_basis":{"derived_from":"product.schedule_ops.availability_engine","classification":"normative_expansion_v0.9.0"},"operation_contracts":[],"entitlement_profiles":["entitlement.product_standard"]}'::jsonb, 'development', '19a7472b207fab3e71587b918919b498b22bee1a0ad316cf73d17b6bc056ef86', '{"source_repo":"cestari-studio/genOS","source_sha":"ffd97fa93ab425fff6bac5015d34944ef924090c","source_path":"docs/specs/v0.9.0/registries/feature-registry.json","source_blob_sha":"d4f32dea850083c96cd4e09d9402f471473f1628","registry_version":"0.9.0"}'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (feature_key) DO UPDATE SET domain_type = EXCLUDED.domain_type, product_key = EXCLUDED.product_key, subproduct_key = EXCLUDED.subproduct_key, name = EXCLUDED.name, summ